  "title": "Mawson Infrastructure Group Inc Relocating 5,376 ASIC Miners to Pennsylvania Sites",
  "summary": "Mawson Infrastructure Group Inc. (NASDAQ:MIGI) (“Mawson” or the “Company”), a digital infrastructure provider, announces today that it has closed its facility in Condong, NSW, Australia, with a focus on its operations in the United States exclusively, with all Mawson owned ASIC miners and MDC equipment being transferred to Pennsylvania for deployment.",
